    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="32.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 32.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ burhbota ⁊ bricbota aginne man georne on æghwilcon ende ⁊ fyrdunga eac ⁊ scipfyrdunga ealswa, a þonne neod sy, swa swa man geræde for gemænelicre neode.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And the repairing of fortifications and of bridges shall be diligently undertaken on every side, and also the provision of military and naval forces, whever the occasion demands, as may be ordered for our common need.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And burhbota ⁊ bricbota aginne man georne, and fyrdunga eac swa, á þonne þearf sy for gemǽnelicre neode.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
